        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Just in case somebody wants this now here is my implementation:\r\n[Gist](https://gist.github.com/ibutra/24a741496dd60bb2e33a045d84db42b1)\r\n\r\nThis should be an equivalent algorithm to the one used in Mini.Pick but with added `!` operator.\r\nNote: The original sorting is preserved with the `!` operator because obviously I can't sort based on the length of the match.\r\n\r\nAlso anybody including you echanovski feel free to use this in any way you like including inspiration ;)\r\n\r\nAlso any feedback is of course welcome",
